  r:"King Khalid International Airport in Riyadh is one of the busiest airports in the region. Every day, thousands of passengers pass through its terminals. Before a flight, passengers must check in, either online or at the desk, and drop off their large bags. Then they go through passport control and security, where their hand luggage is checked by machines. After that, they can relax in the waiting area until their gate opens. Experienced travellers say the best advice is simple: always arrive early, and keep your passport in a safe place.",
